OL,3,ADozens of residents to be displaced
OL,4,Aovernight as counter-terror police
OL,5,Acontinue RAF Fairford probe
OL,6,
OL,7,FDisplaced residents from more than 80
OL,8,Fevacuated houses will not return to
OL,9,Ftheir homes tonight as counter-terror
OL,10,Fpolice continue to investigate a major
OL,11,Fincident near RAF Fairford
OL,13,FFive men have been arrested and remain
OL,14,Fin custody - they were arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of committing offences under
OL,16,Fthe Explosives Act, and on suspicion of
OL,17,Fpreparation of a terrorist act
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
