OL,3,ABurnham proposes NHS-style social care
OL,4,Asystem for England
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham wants to offer access to
OL,7,Ffree social care services to everyone
OL,8,Fin England, and will put his plans
OL,9,Fbefore voters at the next general
OL,10,Felection.
OL,12,FThe prime minister told the BBC that it
OL,13,Fwould be a system in which "everyone
OL,14,Fcontributes, everyone is covered". He
OL,15,Fdid not rule out tax rises,
OL,16,Facknowledging it may be "difficult or
OL,17,Funpopular" with some.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
